OL,3,GNEWSARobinson shared photos of
OL,4,Areporter's family, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitical activist Tommy Robinson
OL,7,Fshared pictures of a journalist's
OL,8,Ffamily online and threatened to visit
OL,9,Fhis home, a court has heard.
OL,11,FIn July last year, the 43-year-old from
OL,12,FBedfordshire, whose real name is
OL,13,FStephen Yaxley-Lennon, pleaded not
OL,14,Fguilty to two counts of harassment
OL,15,Fcausing fear of violence towards
OL,16,Freporters Andrew Young and Jacob
OL,17,FDirnhuber.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
