OL,3,GNEWSARobinson shared photos of
OL,4,Areporter's family, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter three young girls were murdered
OL,7,Fin Southport in July 2024, Robinson
OL,8,Fposted on social media, which alerted
OL,9,Fthe Daily Mail to the fact he was on
OL,10,Fholiday in Cyprus. The paper published
OL,11,Farticles of him "on a sunbed".
OL,13,FSouthwark Crown Court heard that photos
OL,14,Fof Young's wife and child were later
OL,15,Fshared to Robinson's social media
OL,16,Ffollowers.
